<p>International Scientific and Academic Research Publisher is an international publisher committed to providing a ‘peer reviewed’ platform to outstanding researchers and scientists to exhibit their findings for the furtherance of society to provoke debate and provide an educational forum.</p><p>It's aim is to serve for the scholars and researchers all over the world by means of fast publishing and to get the widest exposure by providing free access. International Scientific and Academic Research Publishers team works with full dedication to improve the services and to maintain high quality standards.</p><h2>Our Journal List</h2><?php $__currentLoopData = $journals; $__env->addLoop($__currentLoopData); foreach($__currentLoopData as $journal): $__env->incrementLoopIndices(); $loop = $__env->getLastLoop(); ?><div class="border border-primary p-3 mb-2"><b><a href="<?php echo e(route('journal',$journal['slug']??$journal['j_id'])); ?>"><?php echo e($journal['j_name']); ?></a></b><div><b>Journal starting year:</b> <?php echo e($journal['starting_year']??''); ?></div><div><b>Frequency:</b> <?php echo e($journal['frequency']??''); ?></div></div><?php endforeach; $__env->popLoop(); $loop = $__env->getLastLoop(); ?><h2>Policies</h2><p><b><a href="/author-instruction">Guidelines to Authors:</a></b> Go through our guidelines for authors before submitting your manuscript that will assist in preparing your manuscript as per format of the journal.</p><p><b><a href="/EthicsPolicies">Ethics &amp; Policies:</a></b> The guidelines that are developed to ensure world class scientific publication and proper credit for author's original ideas and research.</p><p><b><a href="/reviewProcess">Peer Review Policy:</a></b> All submitted manuscripts undergo a rigorous peer-review process by at least two independent reviewers before acceptance.</p><p><b><a href="/EditorGuidlines">Editorial Policies:</a></b> Role of Editors ensure the quality of the journal by making fruitful relations with author, reviewers and adhere to high value responsibilities towards other board members.</p><p><b><a href="/CopyrightPolicyPage">Copyright Policy:</a></b> All manuscripts are published under Open Access, allowing immediate and free full-text access upon publication under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License.</p><p><b><a href="/PublicationFee">Publication Fee:</a></b> Article Processing Charges (APC) cover the costs of peer review, editorial handling, production, hosting, distribution, indexing, and promotion required to transform a submitted manuscript into a published article.</p><p><b><a href="/open-access-policy">Open Access Policy:</a></b> ISAR Publisher bridges the gap between research and communication by providing open access to all journals, empowering the global research community through unrestricted, accessible, and inclusive scholarly content.</p><p><b><a href="/RefundPolicy">Cancellation/Refund Policy:</a></b> ISAR Publisher follows a clear policy for article correction, retraction, or removal to maintain academic integrity, transparency, and accuracy, in accordance with established publishing ethics guidelines.</p><p><b><a href="/GenerativeAIPolicy">Generative AI Policy:</a></b> The Use of Generative AI and AIAssisted Technologies in Writing for ISAR Publisher</p>
